For arm64e, Apple's stack probe is called through an authenticated pointer as Xcode 27.0's clang calls it: adrp and
add of l___chkstk_darwin$auth_ptr$ia$0$addr into x17 (with an AdrpAdd linker optimization hint), ldr x16, [x17] and
blraa x16, x17; the slot in __DATA,__auth_ptr holds ___chkstk_darwin@AUTH(ia,0,addr) (B-170, docs/formats/build.md
"Stack checks").
